msgid ""
"Cloud Uploader could not find ffmpeg, so this recording will be uploaded as "
"a WAV file instead of {format}. If ffmpeg is installed, open NVDA's "
"settings, go to Cloud Uploader, and set the path to ffmpeg.exe there; leave "
"it blank to have Cloud Uploader search your PATH and a few common install "
"locations automatically."
msgstr ""
"Cloud Uploader no pudo encontrar ffmpeg, así que esta grabación se subirá "
"como archivo WAV en lugar de {format}. Si tienes ffmpeg instalado, abre la "
"configuración de NVDA, ve a Cloud Uploader y ahí establece la ruta a "
"ffmpeg.exe; déjalo en blanco para que Cloud Uploader busque en tu PATH y "
"algunas ubicaciones comunes automáticamente."

msgid "ffmpeg not found"
msgstr "No se encontró ffmpeg"

msgid ""
"Encoding to {format} failed, so this recording will be uploaded as a WAV file instead. ffmpeg reported:\n"
"\n"
"{error}"
msgstr ""
"La codificación a {format} falló, así que esta grabación se subirá como archivo WAV. ffmpeg reportó:\n"
"\n"
"{error}"

